# tpot-automation — what must never be committed.
#
# This file is in the FIRST commit on purpose. Most of the patterns below name
# artefacts that carry a plaintext credential, and git history is not
# retractable in practice: a secret that is committed and then removed is still
# in the object store, in every clone and in every fork.

# --- Plaintext credential backups -------------------------------------------
# The installer this project replaces wrote one timestamped, world-readable
# copy of its credentials file per run and never cleaned them up. This tool
# creates none, but a user migrating from the old one will have some lying
# around in the directory they run us from.
*.bak*

# --- macOS zip debris --------------------------------------------------------
# A release downloaded and unzipped on macOS carries these back into the tree.
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
._*

# --- Run-time state that is regenerated, and may hold secrets ---------------
# T-Pot's own environment file, and any local copy of one.
.env
# The merged configuration document. Written to a 0700 tmpfs run directory at
# run time, mode 0600; it holds every supplied value, including the password.
merged.json
# Generated inventory. Written by install.sh on every run.
inventories/local/*
!inventories/local/.gitkeep
# Answer files. Named by convention so a file left beside the tree by accident
# is ignored rather than committed. The real ones live outside the tree, in
# /root, mode 0600 — install.sh refuses an answer file inside the repo.
answers*.yml
answers*.json
tpot*.yml.local

# --- Tool output -------------------------------------------------------------
*.retry
*.log
*.tfstate*
collections/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Deliberate exceptions ---------------------------------------------------
# Test fixtures are named after the artefacts above on purpose: the .env
# rewriting, the merged document and the transcript all need fixtures with
# realistic names. Keep them tracked. (A negation only works because no parent
# directory of these paths is itself ignored.)
!tests/fixtures/**/.env
!tests/fixtures/**/*.env
!tests/fixtures/**/merged.json
!tests/fixtures/**/*.log
